UPDATE businesses SET description = 'Tasca Mozambique is a Mozambican-Portuguese restaurant at 163 Victoria Road in Woodstock, Cape Town. The restaurant brings the flavours of the Mozambican coast to the city, offering a relaxed, halaal-friendly setting that welcomes families, groups of friends and anyone keen to try food with an Afro-Portuguese character.

The menu centres on traditional dishes built around bold spices and fresh ingredients. Flame-grilled peri-peri chicken is a highlight, served with the fiery, garlicky sauce that Mozambican cooking is known for. Seafood lovers can choose spiced seafood platters, while rich, slow-cooked stews offer hearty comfort food. Prego rolls, the classic Portuguese steak sandwich, make a satisfying lighter meal or lunchtime option. Portions are generous, and the friendly staff are happy to guide first-time visitors through the menu and help them choose how much heat they can handle. The warm, informal atmosphere suits a casual dinner, a weekend lunch or a celebration with family. Its location on Victoria Road puts it within easy reach of the city centre and the rest of Woodstock. Tasca Mozambique is at 163 Victoria Road, Woodstock, Cape Town.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'tasca-mozambique-woodstock' AND description = 'Tasca Mozambique is a Mozambican-Portuguese cuisine restaurant on Victoria Road in Woodstock offering halaal-friendly dining.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
