The shelves carry food for dogs, cats and other household pets, from everyday brands to specialised diets, along with pet medicines and treatments to help keep animals healthy. Accessories such as bowls, leads, collars, beds and toys sit alongside grooming and care products. The store also caters for pigeon fanciers, with specialised racing pigeon food mixes that can be hard to find elsewhere. Staff are helpful and accommodating, and customers who feed several animals or keep birds can arrange bulk orders to save time and money. Because it is a local, owner-run business, regular customers get personal service and practical advice on choosing the right food and products for their pets. Pet Utopia is at Shop 7, corner of Thornton and Massey Avenue, Crawford, Cape Town.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'pet-utopia-crawford' AND description = 'Pet Utopia is a pet supply store in Crawford stocking pet food, accessories and other requirements for the local community.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
