The kitchen focuses on wholesome food made with fresh ingredients, from hearty breakfasts and brunch plates in the morning to lighter meals at lunchtime. Freshly baked treats are on offer for anyone who just wants something sweet with their coffee, and the coffee itself is one of the main reasons regulars keep coming back. The cosy interior and warm, friendly service make it an easy place to linger over a catch-up with friends or a quiet moment alone. Being close to Fish Hoek''s main beach and the popular Jager Walk, the café is a natural stop for a drink or a bite after a morning walk along the water. The Stag Café & Deli is at Shop 6, Recreation Road, Fish Hoek, Cape Town.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'the-stag-and-maiden-cafe-fish-hoek' AND description = 'The Stag & Maiden Cafe is a coffee shop on Recreation Road in Fish Hoek, serving breakfast and light meals through the day.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
