The ranges are spread across several of the group''s in-house labels, so shoppers can find relaxed streetwear and weekend casuals in the same visit as office wear and smarter outfits for evenings out and special occasions. Footwear and accessories such as bags, belts and jewellery help complete a look, and new seasonal collections keep the rails current throughout the year. Customers can pay cash or by card, or open a Truworths store account that lets them spread the cost of purchases over time. Staff are on hand to help with sizes, fitting and putting an outfit together. Being in Liberty Promenade, one of Mitchells Plain''s main shopping centres, makes it easy to combine a wardrobe update with other errands. Truworths is at Shop 57C, Liberty Promenade, AZ Berman Drive, Mitchells Plain, Cape Town.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'truworths-liberty-promenade-mitchells-plain' AND description = 'Truworths is a South African fashion and lifestyle clothing retailer, with a branch in Liberty Promenade, Mitchell''s Plain.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
