Shoppers will find fresh fruit and vegetables, quality meat and poultry, dairy and a wide range of pantry staples and household essentials. Specialist counters add to the everyday range, including a deli with ready-made meals and cold meats, a bakery with fresh bread and pastries, and a fish counter that suits a seaside neighbourhood where many like to cook fresh fish at home. A selection of local and international wines makes it easy to pick up a bottle for dinner or a braai. The store offers good value on everyday groceries, and the centre''s parking makes loading up a full trolley straightforward. Checkers Big Bay is at Seaside Village Shopping Centre, corner of Cormorant Road and Otto du Plessis Drive, Big Bay, Bloubergstrand, Cape Town.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'checkers-big-bay-bloubergstrand' AND description = 'Checkers Big Bay is a supermarket at Seaside Village Shopping Centre in Big Bay, Bloubergstrand, part of the Checkers chain.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
