The spacious shop carries casual sneakers, sports and running shoes, athleisure styles and durable everyday footwear for men, women and children. Shoppers can compare popular international brands side by side, which makes it easier to find the right fit and style for school, gym, work or weekends. Regular promotions and value deals help stretch the budget further, especially when buying for the whole family at once. Helpful floor staff can fetch sizes from the storeroom and offer advice on choosing a shoe for a particular sport or activity. Access Park is known as a factory and outlet shopping destination, so bargain hunters can make a day of it and visit several stores in one trip. Footgear is at Shop A17, Access Park, 1 Van Riebeeck Road, Kuils River, Cape Town.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'footgear-kuils-river' AND description = 'Footgear is a footwear retail store, part of a national South African shoe chain, located within Access Park in Kuils River.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
