The store is especially known for its baby range, with soft bodysuits, sleepwear and outfits that are easy to wash and wear. School wear is another mainstay, so parents can pick up shirts, trousers, skirts and jerseys in time for the new term. Everyday basics such as T-shirts, underwear, socks and comfortable casual wear make up much of the adult range, alongside seasonal items that change through the year. Lay-by lets customers reserve items and pay them off over time, which helps when buying bigger quantities for school or the festive season. The store also sells cellphones and related products. A tidy, well-organised layout makes it easy to find sizes quickly. Ackermans is at Shop 24 and 26, Lansdowne Corner Shopping Centre, corner of Lansdowne Road and Jan Smuts Drive, Lansdowne, Cape Town.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'ackermans-lansdowne-corner-lansdowne' AND description = 'Ackermans Lansdowne Corner is a fashion and clothing retailer trading from the Lansdowne Corner Shopping Centre in Lansdowne.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
